      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mention \"traditional polish\" and \"gravitas\" specifically when distinguishing between them. Can you dig a bit deeper into that? \n\nBe honest—when you say Arjun might lack that \"polish\" or that Marcus's style might not translate to the boardroom, are you suggesting there's a certain look, tone, or way of carrying oneself that is just more standard for these types of high-level corporate environments? Like, what exactly is missing from their profiles that Sterling has?",
